  "configuration_id": "config_025",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence is that multiprofile RNA with avgpool and weighted fusion is currently best, especially config_019 at 0.639 accuracy. The main uncertainty is whether the image modality contributes meaningfully, since image-only ResNet50 was weak and no ViT image encoder has been tested. config_025 keeps the current best RNA encoder, profile, aggregation, and fusion while replacing ResNet50 with imagenet_vit_l, isolating the effect of image representation. This is a high-value next experiment because it either improves on the best known configuration or clarifies whether the image branch is adding useful information under the strongest known setup."
}

